     ],
     "comparison": "Replaces the mandatory 8/100k recall trigger with a regulator discretionary decision (outside the acceptable range, which requires a mandatory numeric trigger). Sits alongside Northwind's S2 24-month, no-interim-cap pathway with no automatic placement ban, so each company's own benefit section is weakened in the same draft.",
